     1	# QA Scenarios
     2	
     3	Seed QA assets for the private `qa-lab` extension.
     4	
     5	Files:
     6	
     7	- `scenarios/index.yaml` - canonical QA scenario pack, kickoff mission, and operator identity.
     8	- `scenarios/<theme>/*.yaml` - one runnable scenario per YAML file.
     9	- `frontier-harness-plan.md` - big-model bakeoff and tuning loop for harness work.
    10	- `convex-credential-broker/` - standalone Convex v1 lease broker for pooled live credentials.
    11	
    12	Key workflow:
    13	
    14	- `qa suite` is the executable frontier subset / regression loop.
    15	- `qa manual` is the scoped personality and style probe after the executable subset is green.
    16	- `qa coverage` prints the scenario coverage inventory from scenario YAML.
    17	
    18	Operator workflows:
    19	
    20	- Use the `openclaw-qa-testing` skill for QA Lab live lanes, Convex credential
    21	  pool operations, and WhatsApp live credential setup/replacement.
    22	
    23	Keep this folder in git. Add new scenarios here before wiring them into automation.
